==Trivia==
The ultra rare card is the first to feature a Pokémon other than a {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}}.

===Origin===
*'''More Poison''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Seviper|50}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*The '''New Wave''' attack is named after {{wp|new wave music|new wave}}, a genre of music. The name may have been chosen in relation to {{p|Nihilego}}'s jellyfish-like design, its home of [[Ultra Deep Sea]], and its in-lore ability to manipulate the mind (brain waves).
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

